xt-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Schedule 05:30 AM To 01:30 PM<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">05:30 AM &#8211; 06:00 AM<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Wake up and Half Bath<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">06:30 AM &#8211; 07:30 AM<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Shatkarma | Pranayama | Mantra Learning<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">07.30 AM &#8211; 08:00 AM<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>GREEN TEA<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">08.00 AM &#8211; 09:45 AM<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Holistic Hatha Yoga Practice | Prana Kriya | Raja Yoga<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">09:45 AM &#8211; 11:00 AM<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>BREAKFAST<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">11:00 AM &#8211; 1:00 PM<br \/><strong>Workshop of Asana\u00a0 | Practicum | Body Adjustment &#8211; Alignment | Anatomy &amp; Physiology<\/strong><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">1:00 PM &#8211; 02:00 PM<br \/><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Lunch<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">02:00 PM \u2013 03:00 PM<br \/><strong>Personal Time<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"t