cient Indian yoga practices, complete with all the traditional tools. This was my first exposure to intensive practices with powerful Kriyas, and I was particularly impressed by their meticulous approach to alignment and adjustments. All the teachers are also fluent in English, enhancing the learning experience.\n\nI had thought this trip to Goa would be my last, but after my experience at Purnam Yoga Shala, I am eagerly planning to return with my family to deepen my practice.\n\nThank you, and I look forward to continuing my journey with your online classes! I highly recommend Purnam Yoga Shala to anyone looking to experience a thorough yoga practice.<!-- R-CONTENT --><\/div> <span class=\"ti-read-more\" data-container=\".ti-review-content\" data-collapse-text=\"Hide\" data-open-text=\"Read more\" ><\/span> <\/div> <\/div>  <div data-empty=\"0\" class=\"ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail\" data-id=\"cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da\" > <div class=\"ti-inner\"> <div class=\"ti-review-header\"> <trustindex-image class=\"ti-platform-icon\" data-imgurl=\"https:\/\/cdn.trustindex.io\/assets\/platform\/Google\/icon.svg\" alt=\"Google\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" ><\/trustindex-image> <div class=\"ti-profile-img\"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/a\/ACg8ocIQaDLOPiLDgLRMftBKBhjP6vt1CD4zCMAs7CEV1zNxBs_Evg=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100\" data-imgurlset=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/a\/ACg8ocIQaDLOPiLDgLRMftBKBhjP6vt1CD4zCMAs7CEV1zNxBs_Evg=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x\" alt=\"Marion Morisod profile picture\" loading=\"lazy\" ><\/trustindex-image> <\/div> <div class=\"ti-profile-details\"> <div class=\"ti-name\"> Marion Morisod <\/div> <div class=\"ti-date\">2024-04-29<\/div> <\/div> <\/div> <span class=\"ti-stars\"><trustindex-image class=\"ti-star\" data-imgurl=\"https:\/\/cdn.trustindex.io\/assets\/platform\/Google\/star\/f.svg\" alt=\"Google\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" loading=\"lazy\" ><\/trustindex-i